Gomrey Mac App Store provisioning profile placeholder

Real provisioning profiles are local secrets and must not be committed.

For MAS development:
- Register the App ID in your Apple Developer account.
- Set GOMREY_MAS_APP_ID to that exact App ID.
- Set GOMREY_TEAM_ID to your Apple Developer Team ID.
- Create a development provisioning profile and set
  GOMREY_MAS_DEV_PROVISIONING_PROFILE to its absolute path, or place it at
  electron/build/GomreyMASDev.provisionprofile.

For App Store distribution:
- Create a distribution provisioning profile for the same App ID.
- Set GOMREY_MAS_PROVISIONING_PROFILE to its absolute path, or place it at
  electron/build/GomreyMAS.provisionprofile.

Gomrey does not accept donor Presenton App IDs, Team IDs, profiles, or signing
variables as fallbacks.
